  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-rooms-express-install/#main-content)\n\n![Microsoft Teams logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Microsoft-Teams-26.svg)\n\n# MicrosoftTeamsRoomsExpressInstall\n\nInstantly transform small spaces into Microsoft Teams Rooms.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![Two people in a Microsoft Teams Room hosting a hybrid meeting with remote participants.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Accordion-Express-Install-Jabra-PanaCast-50-VBS.jpg)\n\n### Ready-to-Deploy Microsoft Teams Rooms Bundles\n\nTeams want more collaboration spaces. And they want them now. IT needs to maintain standards and control. Express Install delivers it all.\n\nNow you can easily bring the native Teams Room experience to any space. Avoid complex design and speed up deployment and time-to-value with secure Microsoft Teams Rooms bundles.\n\n**Simplify BYOD Migration**\n\nExpress Install also transforms unmanaged Bring Your Own Device spaces into Teams Rooms, enabling “one-touch join” experiences and centralized management.\n\n**Curated and custom packages**\n\nAVI-SPL offers ready-to-buy Microsoft Teams Rooms Express Install bundles and custom solutions.\n\n[Shop now](https://shop.avispl.com/collections/shop?q=LG+Express&tab=products), or contact us to create a bundle that fits your needs and budget. Prefer different hardware or a mobile cart instead of a stand? Just ask.\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-rooms-express-install/#contact)\n\n## WhyPowerEveryMeetingwithMicrosoftTeams?\n\n- ###### Keep control\n\n\n\n\nControl and track meetings with the brain, eyes, and ears in every room. Track room meeting analytics and streamline meetings with access to Facilitator and Interpreter Microsoft 365 Copilot agents.\n\n- ###### Offer consistent user experiences\n\n\n\n\nEveryone collaborates with ease. In every space. Anytime.\n\n- ###### Block BYOD hazards\n\n\n\n\nEliminate unsecured personal devices to keep data safe and block malware from compromising your network.\n\n- ###### Let users choose where to meet\n\n\n\n\nDevices don’t have to be tethered to a wall. Teams choose where to meet with bundles mounted on stands or mobile carts.\n\n\n![Dark-haired person with glasses uses laptop, viewing software list; notebook and pen on wooden desk; room lit by natural light.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/stock-CC_Experiences_6-scaled-1-scaled.jpg)\n\n### Support Sustainability Goals\n\nYour AVI-SPL team can also help you choose hardware that meets your sustainability standards. Options include devices built with recycled components and streamlined, recyclable packaging.\n\n### ShopReady-Made  Bundles\n\nWe offer secure, user-friendly Microsoft Teams Rooms solutions with curated hardware ready for purchase today. These bundles feature LG displays, Jabra video bars, and Salamander stands. Order now to get your spaces up and running quickly.\n\n[Shop now](https://shop.avispl.com/collections/shop?q=LG+Express&tab=products)\n\n## Express Install Use Cases\n\n###### Franchises\n\nCreate a consistent experience across large groups like car dealerships and other dispersed groups.\n\n###### Government agencies\n\nSecure meeting spaces for inter-departmental and constituent communications.\n\n###### Municipal Courts\n\nFacilitate secure, reliable communication between court personnel and participants with streamlined technology.\n\n## WhyChooseAVI-SPLandMicrosoftTeamsRooms?\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTE](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-rooms-express-install/#contact)\n\n- ###### Proven expertise\n\n\n\n\nBenefit from our years of experience designing and implementing Microsoft Teams Rooms.\n\n- ###### Customizable solutions\n\n\n\n\nWe can tailor Express Install components to fit your needs and budget.\n\n- ###### Reliable technology\n\n\n\n\nTrust our preferred partners’ reputations and history of providing high-quality, reliable products. We work with leading providers like LG, Jabra, Salamander, and more.\n\n- [**Comprehensive support** \\\\\n\\\\\nAVI-SPL provides ongoing support and maintenance to ensure your system operates smoothly.](https://avispl.com/microsoft-teams-rooms-express-install/#contact)\n\nWe noticed you're in Canada.\n\nVisit **avispl.ca** instead?\n\nYes, take me thereNo, stay on this site",
